{"availability":"available","full":"phaethix/inkstone","name":"inkstone","description":"Local-first novel-to-comic generator — free, no GPU, pluggable providers.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":8,"forks":5,"created":"2026-07-20T02:19:18Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:54:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://phaethix.github.io/inkstone/","topics":["agnes","ai","character-consistency","comic","comic-generator","generative-ai","image-generation","local-first","manga","mit-license","multimodal","novel","open-source","openai-compatible","python","text-to-image"],"demo":"https://phaethix.github.io/inkstone/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.666Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.666Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.666Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.666Z","stars":8,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Inkstone reads a local txt novel and, through the free Agnes multimodal API, produces comic pages with cross-panel character consistency — exported as PDF / PNG. No GPU, no paid plan: just one free API key.","These panels were generated from the bundled sample (examples/scene1.txt) with the default L1+L2 pipeline — no L3, straight from the model. Consistency here is \"medium\" by design: the honest ceiling of a free, no-GPU model. More samples, including the full webtoon strip, are at:","Every novel-to-comic tool we surveyed in 2026 runs on a paid model — Gemini, OpenAI, Doubao, Wenxin, or Claude. Inkstone is built differently: it is Agnes-native and zero-cost, the one combination no other open-source generator occupies."],"features":["Free & local-first — one AGNESAPIKEY, no GPU, no paid plan.","Agnes-native multimodal — agnes-3.0-flash for scripting, agnes-image-2.5-flash for t2i and i2i consistency.","Pluggable ImageProvider — Agnes by default; PROVIDER=openaicompat for Agnes-protocol-compatible /images/generations gateways (i2i uses extrabody.image).","Character consistency engine — L1 prompt hard-description + L2 reference img2img, the robust path under no-GPU. An optional L3 PIL/OpenCV face overlay is off by default (opt-in via INKSTONEL3=1).","Reliability layer — token-bucket rate limiting, exponential-backoff retries, and error collection against 429/503."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phaethix/inkstone/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"74730b59d0218e2c9bc837abeb6df20c28ec875f6fe58916c9153f36c0b135dc","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.848Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.848Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Inkstone reads a local txt novel and, through the free Agnes multimodal API, produces comic pages with cross-panel character consistency — exported as PDF / PNG. No GPU, no paid plan: just one free API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phaethix/inkstone/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The strongest approaches (IP-Adapter / InsightFace) need a local GPU running SDXL/Flux — incompatible with Inkstone's zero-cost premise.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phaethix/inkstone/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"74730b59d0218e2c9bc837abeb6df20c28ec875f6fe58916c9153f36c0b135dc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phaethix/inkstone/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.849Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T14:54:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phaethix/inkstone/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.850Z","hash":"74730b59d0218e2c9bc837abeb6df20c28ec875f6fe58916c9153f36c0b135dc","originalBytes":10897,"storedBytes":10897,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["inkstone","agnes","image","comic","docs","api","default","key","consistency","free","page","gpu","mode","runs","webtoon","examples","layout","model","one","openai","paid","panel","provider","run","scripts","set","base","character","c